 | [[Economic liberalism]]|ref|{{Cite web |date=2024-10-09 |title=Kassab à CNN: PSD é liberal e se preocupa com a responsabilidade fiscal |url=https://www.cnnbrasil.com.br/politica/kassab-a-cnn-psd-e-liberal-e-se-preocupa-com-a-responsabilidade-fiscal/ |access-date=2026-02-20 |website=CNN Brasil |quote=Segundo o líder partidário, o programa econômico do PSD foi elaborado por Guilherme Afif Domingos, reconhecido economista liberal. Kassab esclareceu: "É evidente que um liberal de um partido de centro, um programa liberal, é um partido que admite gastos expressivos em saúde pública, na educação, na defesa, no Judiciário". |trans-quote=According to the party leader, the PSD's economic program was developed by Guilherme Afif Domingos, a renowned liberal economist. Kassab clarified: "It is evident that a liberal from a centrist party, with a liberal program, is a party that allows for significant spending on public health, education, defense, and the judiciary." |language=pt-BR}}|</ref>|}} {{refn|ref| name=":0" |ref|{{Cite web |last=Bouchard |first=Joseph |date=2024-10-09 |title=Divided Conservative Movement Wins Big in Brazil's Municipal Elections |url=https://www.realclearworld.com/articles/2024/10/09/divided_conservative_movement_wins_big_in_brazils_municipal_elections_1063954.html |access-date=2025-09-10 |website=RealClearWorld |language=en}}|</ref>|ref|{{Cite web |last=Franco |first=Luiza |date=2025-04-02 |title=Brazil’s Low-Key Operator |url=https://americasquarterly.org/article/brazils-low-key-operator/ |access-date=2025-09-09 |website=Americas Quarterly}}|</ref>}}

