om), at the far right of the Israeli political spectrum, was founded in 1948 by Menahem Begin, leader of the Irgun Zvai Leumi terrorist organization. |publisher=University of Michigan |date=1970 |page=97 }}|</ref>|ref|{{cite book |author=American University (Washington, D.C.). Foreign Area Studies |editor=Richard F. Nyrop |url=https://www.google.com/books/edition/Israel_a_Country_Study/-KFZAbLeGIwC?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=%22far-right%22+%22Herut%22&dq=%22far-right%22+%22Herut%22 |title=
